#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = bordos limpos ao tamaño de renderizado do xogo. DLSS = o mesmo, e escala cara arriba cando "
"o Escalado do xogo é inferior ao 100 %. Mestura = o TAA propio do xogo mesturado con DLAA / DLSS: "
"máis calmo, algo máis suave. off = a imaxe do xogo. Gárdase ao instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Canto da mestura é o TAA do xogo, 0 - 100 % en pasos do 10 %: máis = máis calmo e suave, menos = "
"máis nítido. Amósase mentres o Modo é Mestura ou unha división ten un lado de mestura. Sen custo "
"extra."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Perfís para a túa tarxeta gráfica. high = todo activado (modelo 1). medium = modelo 2, un arranxo "
"de cristais e valos máis lixeiro, retrovisores sen Seguir pezas móbiles. low = ademais sen "
"Retrovisores suaves, sen arranxo de cristais e valos, área VR 60 %. Nunca cambia un axuste que "
"puxeses ti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = máis detalle, texto máis nítido, uns 1,6 veces a GPU do 2. 2 (E) = equilibrado, menos "
"rastros detrás do tráfico: comeza aquí. 3 (F) = o máis tranquilo en valos e cables, pode esborrar "
"detalles en movemento, mesmo custo que o 2. 4 (M) = o máis pesado (uns 5 veces), só probas en "
"plano."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Calidade de imaxe: nitidez, nitidez de textura, arranxo de cristais e valos, arranxo de rastros "
"de luz e a área DLAA. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre "
"o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta a nitidez despois do DLAA, de 0 (desactivado) a 1,0. Súbea se a imaxe se ve suave; moi "
"alto fai halos claros nos bordos. Custa uns 0,1 ms; 0 sáltase o paso."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Alcance da nitidez, de 1 a 4 px: pequeno = detalle fino, grande = bordos máis marcados. Cámbiao "
"se a nitidez parece demasiado fina ou grosa; unha imaxe maior ca a pantalla, como en VR, precisa "
"máis de 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Texto de textura máis nítido (sinais, taboleiro, GPS). 0 = desactivado; máis negativo = máis "
"nítido pero máis cintilación nos valos; proba de -0,5 a -1 se o texto se ve borroso. Case sen "
"custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"O mesmo para valos de arame, herba e follas: sobe cara a 0 se os valos cintilan, baixa se a herba "
"se ve branda. igual = segue a fila de enriba. Só funciona se Nitidez de textura non é 0. Case sen "
"custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Cables, valos e cristais trátanse como o que está diante, non como o que se ve a través, para que "
"non se esborren ao moverte. Desactívao se non ves esborrado: aforra 0,02 - 0,06 ms por ollo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Evita que os brillos de farolas e luces de coche deixen rastro ao moverte: os brillos debúxanse "
"de novo en cada fotograma en vez de mesturarse cos anteriores. Pasos do 25 %; baixa se os brillos "
"cintilan, 0 = desactivado. Custa uns 0,05 - 0,2 ms por ollo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: só o centro de cada ollo recibe DLAA (20 a 100 %); o bordo mantén a imaxe do xogo. Baixa para "
"permitir un modelo máis pesado ou gañar fps; 40 % custa uns 40 % do modelo. Tamén fixa o camión "
"do garaxe / menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Como o DLAA trata as pezas en movemento e os retrovisores do camión. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"O DLAA segue cada cousa en movemento por separado (tráfico, rodas, matrículas), así mantense "
"nítido e sen rastros. Desactívao só para aforrar uns 0,5 ms por ollo ou para probar: todo se move "
"coa cámara e o tráfico esbórrase."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Suaviza tamén os retrovisores do camión, para que non cintilen. 1 retrovisor = só o máis grande "
"(o principal ao teu lado). todos = cada retrovisor. cámara = o máis barato por retrovisor, o "
"tráfico en movemento pode deixar rastros no cristal; os outros seguen cada cousa en movemento."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"activado = cada retrovisor recibe o DLAA cada 2 fotogramas e mostra a última imaxe limpa entre "
"medias: uns a metade do custo. Bordos limpos; o que se move no vidro actualízase a media taxa. "
"desactivado = cada retrovisor en cada fotograma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Taxa de fotogramas e CPU: axuste de CPU, núcleos de caché AMD, límite de fps e Baixa latencia "
"(Reflex) en plano, límite de fps en VR. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado "
"cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tres interruptores de CPU xuntos. Preferir núcleos rápidos: só CPU Intel con P-cores e E-cores. "
"Prioridade máis alta e sen aforro de enerxía de Windows para o xogo: todas as CPU, Intel e AMD. "
"Axuda cando limita a CPU; sen custo. Por separado en dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, "
"cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"CPU AMD X3D con dous grupos de núcleos (7950X3D, 9950X3D): mantén o xogo nos núcleos coa gran "
"V-Cache 3D, que aos xogos lles gusta. Cambia ao instante; desactivado devolve todos os núcleos ao "
"xogo. Próbao e compara nunha cidade con moito tráfico. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Só en plano. Mantén o xogo como máximo a esta taxa: tempo de fotograma estable, menos calor e "
"consumo. Pónao un pouco por baixo do que o teu PC aguanta nunha cidade con moito tráfico. Con "
"Baixa latencia (Reflex) activada, limita o controlador NVIDIA. desactivado = sen límite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Só en plano, só NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Activado = os fotogramas do xogo esperan menos antes de "
"que a tarxeta gráfica os debuxe: menos atraso entre o volante e a imaxe cando limita a tarxeta. "
"Boost tamén mantén altos os reloxos da tarxeta. Mesmos fps; custo pequeno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. metade = o xogo debuxa un de cada 2 fotogramas do visor (72 Hz -> 36 fps), terzo = un de "
"cada 3; o suavizado do visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing) enche o resto a un ritmo estable. Úsao "
"cando os fps oscilan. Apaga o Turbo mentres está activo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"Aceleracións VR: Turbo, Foveated rendering, saltar os bordos agochados das lentes e se se atopan "
"OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se "
"abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"O Turbo apaga o suavizado de fotogramas do visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Só VR. Activado "
"= o xogo deixa de esperar polo visor en cada fotograma: máis fps só cando limita a CPU (cidades "
"con moito tráfico). Desactívao se a imaxe dá sacudidas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Centro nítido, menos detalle no bordo (só NVIDIA RTX). Aforra tempo de GPU con Escala alta. Só "
"VR. O anel exterior recibe unha cor por cada 2 x 2 píxeles; valos, herba e follas manteñen todo o "
"detalle. Desactívao se o bordo se ve a bloques."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Que tamaño ten o centro nítido do Foveated rendering, 10 - 100 % en pasos do 5 %: máis grande = "
"máis vista nítida, menos aforro; máis pequeno = máis aforro, o detalle baixo comeza máis preto do "
"centro. 80 % (equilibrado) é o valor por defecto; 90 = amplo, 65 = estreito."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Que fai máis groso o Foveated rendering. escena = só o mundo 3D (por defecto). escena + "
"iluminación = tamén a iluminación do xogo, só no bordo extremo: máis aforro. Próbao: busca bordos "
"de luz ou sombra a bloques no lado da túa vista."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Que groso é o anel exterior do Foveated rendering. Normal = 1 cor por cada 2 x 2 píxeles (por "
"defecto). Forte = por 4 x 2, Máx = por 4 x 4: máis aforro de GPU, bordos máis a bloques. O mellor "
"con seguimento ocular, onde nunca miras o anel exterior."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. O centro nítido do Foveated rendering segue os teus ollos nun visor con seguimento "
"ocular (por exemplo Varjo); sen el queda no centro da lente. Precisa o Foveated rendering "
"activado ao iniciar o xogo, se non, un reinicio. Case sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. O xogo sáltase os cantos da lente que nunca ves (o visor infórmaos), debuxa menos píxeles: "
"máis marxe de GPU, a imaxe que ves é a mesma. A primeira activación require reiniciar o xogo. "
"Desactiva se o bordo da vista se ve raro."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = xeración de fotogramas en VR de djules75, descarga á parte "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). atopado = a súa capa está cargada neste xogo e o mod deixa "
"pasar o seu traballo. Inicia a súa app da bandexa antes do xogo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = un conxunto de melloras OpenXR de DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"profundidade, xeración de fotogramas; atopado = a súa capa está cargada no xogo e o mod deixa "
"pasar o seu traballo. Usa só un Turbo (o seu ou o do mod)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Onde flota a IU VR propia do xogo (HUD, menús). O mod escribe o cambio na consola do xogo por ti; "
"precisa g_developer e g_console 1 en config.cfg. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Cal das disposicións da IU VR do xogo moven as filas de abaixo: condución (o HUD ao conducir) ou "
"menús (as pantallas de menú do xogo)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Move a IU VR do xogo: altura, lado, distancia, inclinación, xiro, tamaño ou curva, en pasos "
"pequenos. O xogo recibe cada cambio uns 0,4 s despois da túa última pulsación: a consola ábrese e "
"péchase soa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Dereita: todos os valores de ambas disposicións volven ao que tiña config.cfg ao comezo (o xogo "
"garda os seus propios valores ao saír)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Unha pequena caixa en directo con fps e tempo de fotograma, tamén co menú pechado (plano e VR): "
"fps, ms, só números, cada un con ou sen gráfico dos tempos recentes (os picos saen en vermello), "
"ou só o gráfico. O seu custo de GPU está medido. Gardar consérvaa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fixación, posición, tamaño, cor, distancia VR e xiro da caixa de fps. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move a caixa de fps de lado, en % da pantalla (VR fixo / pegado: graos arredor de ti). Pantalla "
"plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move a caixa de fps arriba / abaixo, en % da pantalla (VR fixo / pegado: graos, menos = arriba). "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fai a caixa de fps máis grande ou máis pequena (0,2 .. 3,0). Sube se non podes lela no visor ou "
"nunha pantalla grande. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto da caixa de fps: 20 cores, cada unha con contorno para lerse sobre calquera imaxe "
"(negro sobre branco = texto escuro, contorno branco). Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Brillo da caixa de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = a cor tal cal, menos escurece o texto (o contorno "
"queda) cara ao negro. Úsao para baixar o contador de noite ou no visor. Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Canto de transparente é toda a caixa de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = sólida, menos esvaece o texto E o "
"seu contorno negro xuntos, para que non quede unha mancha negra. Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Ata onde chega cara atrás o gráfico de fps: 2 - 60 s. Unha barra por cada anaco de tempo = o seu "
"fotograma máis lento, así ves os picos. Verde = a tempo, amarelo = un pouco lento, vermello = "
"unha sacudida; a liña = a taxa do visor / límite de fps / o teu habitual. Móstrase cando Contador "
"de FPS ten gráfico."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. Seguir a cabeza = móvese co visor. Fixo no espazo de xogo = un punto arredor do teu "
"asento, ignora o balance da cabina. Pegado ao vehículo = pegado á cabina, balancéase con ela "
"(precisa DLAA + Seguir pezas móbiles). Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, só Pegado ao vehículo. Activado = cada camión / coche garda o sitio da súa caixa de fps na "
"cabina, xiro, tamaño, cor, brillo e texto (gárdase no dlaa.ini ao pechar o menú). Desactivado = "
"un só conxunto para todos os vehículos. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, só Pegado ao vehículo. Dereita = medir a cabina de novo agora (quieto, aparcado) se a caixa "
"queda fóra de sitio. Esquerda = a caixa deste vehículo volve ao predeterminado (sitio, xiro, "
"tamaño, cor, texto); os outros vehículos manteñen a súa. A caixa queda recta coa cabina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Xira a caixa de fps á esquerda / dereita, en graos (+ = a cara "
"xira á dereita). Úsao para orientar a caixa cando está de lado. 0 = mira cara a ti. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Inclina a caixa de fps, en graos (+ = a parte de arriba "
"afástase de ti, coma deitada no panel). 0 = mira cara a ti. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Xira a caixa de fps no seu propio plano, en graos (+ = sentido "
"horario). 0 = dereita. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A que distancia flota a caixa de fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Mantén o "
"mesmo tamaño na vista a calquera distancia; só cambia a profundidade. Ponla preto da profundidade "
"onde miras para lela sen reenfocar. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Posición, tamaño, profundidade e orientación do panel, e as teclas do menú. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move este panel de lado, en % da pantalla (VR fixo na cabina: graos arredor do asento). Pantalla "
"plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Úsao se o panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move este panel arriba / abaixo, en % da pantalla (VR fixo na cabina: graos, máis = abaixo). "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Úsao se o panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sen "
"custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fai este panel máis grande ou máis pequeno. Sube se non podes lelo, baixa se tapa demasiado. "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un o seu tamaño. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. Seguir a cabeza = o panel segue o visor. Fixo na cabina = queda nun punto diante do teu "
"asento, estable cando miras arredor; X / Y / profundidade fixan ese punto (graos, metros). "
"Precisa a capa VR (predeterminado). Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A que distancia flota o panel: en metros (0,30 - 3,00) como "
"capa VR, o predeterminado; en px de desprazamento por ollo con menu_vr_layer = 0. Mesmo tamaño a "
"calquera profundidade. Cámbiao se cansa mirar. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Activado = o panel xírase cara a ti cando o moves de lado, "
"mesmo tamaño desde calquera ángulo (como capa VR, o predeterminado, tamén a caixa de fps que "
"segue a cabeza); desactivado = imaxe plana. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Interruptores para comparar: DLAA desactivado, o TAA propio do xogo mesturado ou un ao carón do "
"outro, os arranxos de cables, DLAA antes. Nada de aquí fai falta para conducir con normalidade. "
"Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Acende ou apaga todo o mod e garda o modo; desactivado mostra a imaxe do xogo, para comparar. "
"Desactivado aforra o custo de todas as partes xuntas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"on = o mod á esquerda, o TAA propio do xogo á dereita, para comparar (Posición da liña, División: "
"esq. | dereita). Substitúe a Mestura mentres está activado. Coa consola do xogo activada, o mod "
"cambia o Antialiasing do xogo por ti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Onde está a liña de división, 0 - 100 % do ancho en pasos do 5 %: á súa esquerda o DLAA / DLSS do "
"mod, á dereita o TAA do xogo. Só se usa mentres División co TAA do xogo está activada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Que amosa a división nos seus dous lados: DLAA | TAA (o mod á esquerda, o TAA do xogo á dereita), "
"mestura | TAA ou DLAA | mestura (mestura = as dúas mesturadas segundo a Cantidade de mestura). "
"DLSS en lugar de DLAA ao escalar. Só se usa mentres División co TAA do xogo está activada."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Os cables finos móvense ben mentres conduces: o seu movemento esténdese por toda a liña fina. "
"activado = por defecto. desactivado = só para comparar; os cables próximos cintilan máis. A imaxe "
"vese branda un momento ao cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Os cables finos contan como diante en cada píxel que tocan, mesmo onde cobren só unha tira. "
"activado = por defecto. activado (sen A2C) = tamén para bordos translúcidos como as follas. "
"desactivado = só para comparar; os cables próximos cintilan máis."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimental: debuxa os cables afastados máis finos ca 1 píxel como liña de 1 píxel, para que non "
"se rompan en trazos. Desactivado por defecto: os cables afastados poden verse máis escuros ou "
"cintilar máis. Proba e compara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Só en plano: o DLAA execútase antes de que o xogo engada o seu brillo e o aspecto de cor, así as "
"marcas viais, cables e baranda cintilan menos. Cámbiao só para comparar. Non se usa co escalado "
"DLSS nin con HDR de Windows. Mesmo custo nos dous casos; tarda un segundo en cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Informe de erro: preme dúas veces a tecla de captura (ou Captura agora) onde algo se vexa mal; o "
"mod escribe un zip que anexas a unha issue de GitHub. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Un só interruptor para o informe máis completo: detalle do rexistro debug, rebobinado 2 s, "
"captura Completa. Desactivado devolve as filas a como estaban. Só este interruptor se garda; os "
"valores forzados nunca se escriben en dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Que entra en dlaa_inject.log: desactivado = nada; erros = só fallos (por defecto); avisos = + "
"problemas esquivados; info = + inicio e cambios; debug = + estatísticas e medicións de tempo "
"(algo máis lento)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Garda sempre na tarxeta gráfica os últimos 0,5 - 3 s de fotogramas, así o informe mostra o "
"momento ANTES da tecla (+ o que recibiu DLSS nos últimos fotogramas). Gasta memoria gráfica (os "
"MB da columna de custo) e unha copia de imaxe por fotograma. desactivado = ningún."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Rápida = info do sistema, rexistros, axustes, a túa imaxe e DLAA desactivado uns fotogramas (uns "
"1 s). Completa = + o que recibiu DLSS por fotograma (cor, movemento, profundidade) e xogos A/B: "
"vista de movemento, sen movemento, só jitter (uns 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"A tecla de captura. Premea DÚAS veces en 1 s mentres conduces onde algo falle (a primeira "
"pulsación só a arma: un pitido curto). Dereita abre a páxina Atallos na súa liña para cambiala."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Cantas capturas quedan no cartafol dlaa_selftest xunto á DLL: as máis antigas (cartafol + zip) "
"bórranse cando se escribe unha nova. todas = non borrar nunca."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"O idioma deste menú. auto = o idioma do xogo (predeterminado); Esquerda / Dereita escolle outro. "
"Linux / Proton: chinés, xaponés e coreano precisan as súas fontes instaladas, mira o README. Un "
"ficheiro lang\\<code>.po á beira da DLL ten prioridade, para as túas correccións. Gardar "
"consérvao. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Todos os atallos deste menú, unha liña por acción, coa tecla do teclado e o botón do mando. "
"Dereita abre a lista; escolle unha acción con Dereita e preme a nova tecla ou botón do volante. "
"Gárdase no dlaa.ini ao instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Escribe todo o que se ve aquí no dlaa.ini (axustes, e as posicións do panel / caixa de fps unha "
"vez movidas), mantendo as outras liñas. Fai isto cando che guste o resultado, ou os cambios "
"pérdense no próximo inicio. O modo gárdase só."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Devolve cada axuste deste menú a como vén o mod (modelo, nitidez, nitidez de textura, área DLAA, "
"movemento, retrovisores, perfil, panel, contador fps, turbo, foveated, taxa de fotogramas, CPU, "
"detalle do rexistro), en directo e en dlaa.ini, conservando os teus atallos e todas as outras "
"liñas."

#. Value column (about 20 Latin characters)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Desactivado"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "graph only"
msgstr "só gráfico"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
