#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Volve ao menú principal. %hs fai o mesmo en todas as liñas desta páxina. Todas as teclas e botóns "
"do mando, agás as 5 teclas do menú, seguen chegando ao xogo con este menú aberto, así que podes "
"seguir conducindo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Preme UNHA tecla ou botón novo para %ls: calquera tecla, tamén outra tecla do menú (quítaselle). "
"As teclas / botóns xa premidos agora ignóranse ata soltalos. Esc ou Backspace cancela, e 10 s sen "
"premer tamén; as teclas do menú non se poden borrar aquí."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Preme UNHA tecla nova (Shift / Ctrl / Alt con ela fan unha combinación) ou botón / dirección do "
"D-pad. As teclas / botóns xa premidos agora (unha marcha do cambio) ignóranse ata soltalos; os "
"eixes nunca se asignan. %hs ou Esc cancela, Backspace borra a ningún, 10 s sen premer cancela."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Unha das 5 teclas que levan este menú (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, despois preme a nova tecla ou botón: "
"tamén se poden tomar as outras teclas do menú. Estas liñas non se poden borrar, e cada unha das 5 "
"debe manter unha asignación (unha pulsación que deixe outra baleira rexéitase). Gárdase no "
"dlaa.ini ao instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: a key replaces the Keyboard part, a "
"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, despois preme a nova tecla ou botón: unha tecla substitúe a parte "
"Teclado, un botón do mando ou dirección do D-pad a parte Mando. Unha tecla / botón doutra acción "
"pasa aquí. Gárdase no dlaa.ini ao instante."

