#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = captura agora (antes péchase o menú). O zip (cartafol dlaa_selftest xunto á DLL) contén "
"info do sistema, o rexistro do mod e do xogo, dlaa.ini, a túa imaxe e DLAA desactivado; Completa "
"engade o que recibiu DLSS e os xogos A/B; o rebobinado engade o momento anterior. O teu nome de "
"usuario e o cartafol persoal elimínanse. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"As 5 teclas que abren e levan este menú: %hs abre / pecha (o valor), %hs / %hs / %hs / %hs móven "
"(columna Atallo). Co menú aberto só estas 5 se lle quitan ao xogo. %hs: cámbiaas na páxina "
"Atallos."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Pecha o menú; as 5 teclas do menú volven ao xogo. %hs fai o mesmo desde calquera fila."

